The Royal Guard Boots can be found as part of the "[[EX Royal Guard Rumors]]" [[Side Quest]] exclusive to {{TCB}} [[Downloadable Content]] Pack. As part of this Quest, [[Link]] is required to read the ''[[Super Rumor Mill V4]]'' at [[Riverside Stable]].<ref name="BotW Adventure Log"/> In this [[Book]], [[Traysi]] claims that pieces of the [[Royal Guard Set]] can be found in the [[Dining Hall]], near the [[Guards' Chamber]], and on the second floor.<ref name="BotW Super Rumor Mill V4"/>

They Royal Guard Boots are located in an EX [[Treasure Chest]] in the Dining Hall of [[Hyrule Castle (Dungeon)|Hyrule Castle]]. After they have been found, [[Granté]] will begin to sell them in [[Tarrey Town]].{{Note|Prior to the [[The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild#Updates|Version 1.3.3 Update]], Granté would not sell any Armor that is exclusive to the ''[[Breath of the Wild Expansion Pass]]''. This meant that the Royal Guard Boots could not be replaced if sold.}} They Royal Guard Boots are part of the Royal Guard Set, along with the [[Royal Guard Cap]] and [[Royal Guard Uniform]].<ref name="CaC 190"/> Wearing the whole set will decrease the amount of [[Stamina]] required to perform a Charge Attack. The Royal Guard Boots cannot be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]], nor can they be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

